<view class="page circle safe-bottom"><view class="circle-head"><view class="eyebrow">HAIR CARE CIRCLE</view><view class="title">青丝交流圈</view><text>聊接发，也聊每一段变美的心情</text><view><text class="b">2,680</text> 圈友　　<text class="b">368</text> 今日交流</view></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="tabs"><view><text class="active">推荐</text><text>养护经验</text><text>接发问答</text><text>门店交流</text></view></scroll-view><view class="daily"><text class="em">今日话题</text><view><text class="b"># 接发后怎样洗头更顺滑？</text><text>已有86位圈友参与</text></view><text>›</text></view>
<view class="post card" wx:for="{{posts}}" wx:key="id"><view class="author"><view class="avatar">{{item.avatar}}</view><view><text class="b">{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.meta}}</text></view><text class="em">{{item.tag}}</text></view><view class="post-text">{{item.text}}</view><view class="post-images" wx:if="{{item.images.length}}"><image wx:for="{{item.images}}" wx:for-item="pic" wx:key="*this" src="{{pic}}" mode="aspectFill"/></view><view class="actions"><button>♡ {{item.likes}}</button><button>◯ 聊一聊</button><button>↗ 分享</button><button wx:if="{{item.ownerId===currentUserId}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="deletePost" class="delete">⌫ 删除</button></view></view>
<view class="preview" wx:if="{{images.length}}"><view wx:for="{{images}}" wx:key="*this"><image src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill"/><text data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeImage">×</text></view></view><view class="composer"><button bindtap="chooseImage">＋</button><input value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="分享经验，或问问圈友…"/><button bindtap="publish">发布</button></view></view>

